            "block_content": "E. To assist unit members to utilize the opportunities in Sections B, C, and D, the Board agrees to budget not less than $15,000 for the purchase of books, equipment, and other educational resource materials. The Career Development and Educational Improvement Committee may make recommendations concerning the expenditure of these funds.",
